 "remarks": "Discover Darien! Enjoy your summer in the heart of Delafield Island! Walk to town, bike to Pear Tree Beach or relax in the screened porch or on the flagstone terrace of 3 Raiders Lane. This wonderful home offers an open floor plan designed to combine kitchen and family room living. In addition, there's a formal living room, dining room, office and playroom. The skylit Primary bedroom has a cathedral ceiling, beams and balcony overlooking the level landscaped yard, ideal for badmitten, croquet, soccer or volley ball. There is first floor bedroom and bath, plus two additional bedrooms connected by a full bath. This private accessible neighborhood is a walkers/runner's dream!",
